<main>
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container section-head reveal" style="margin-bottom:0">
    <p class="eyebrow">Join the Team</p>
    <h1 style="margin:14px 0 20px;font-size:clamp(36px,5.4vw,64px)">Every role is open.<br>Pick yours.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Surge runs like a real organization. Select one or more roles below, then fill in your details. Every role earns logged volunteer hours, a title, and a letter of service.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<form id="applyForm">
<section id="roles" style="padding-top:20px">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      <article class="card reveal role-card">
        <p class="role">Executive Director / President</p>
        <h3>Thomas Bai</h3>
        <p class="muted">Oversees all operations, sets strategic goals, leads team meetings, and acts as the primary face of the organization.</p>
        <span class="badge" style="margin-top:auto;align-self:flex-start">Filled</span>
      </article>
      <article class="card reveal role-card">
        <p class="role">Vice President</p>
        <h3>Open <span class='open-pill'>Volunteer</span></h3>
        <p class="muted">The primary second-in-command. Drives internal team performance, manages special initiatives, and steps in for the Executive Director to ensure the organization runs smoothly.</p>
        <label class="pick"><input type="checkbox" name="roles" value="Vice President"><span>Apply for this role</span></label>
      </article>
      <article class="card reveal role-card">
        <p class="role">Leading Instructor</p>
        <h3>Open <span class='open-pill'>Volunteer</span></h3>
        <p class="muted">Demonstrates strokes to swimmers in person, on deck and in the water, showing exactly how to gain better form, technique, and efficiency.</p>
        <label class="pick"><input type="checkbox" name="roles" value="Leading Instructor"><span>Apply for this role</span></label>
      </article>
      <article class="card reveal role-card">
        <p class="role">Volunteer Swim Instructor</p>
        <h3>Open <span class='open-pill'>Volunteer</span></h3>
        <p class="muted">Teach group or 1-on-1 lessons, demonstrate proper stroke mechanics, and ensure student safety in the water.</p>
        <label class="pick"><input type="checkbox" name="roles" value="Volunteer Swim Instructor"><span>Apply for this role</span></label>
      </article>
      <article class="card reveal role-card">
        <p class="role">Secretary</p>
        <h3>Open <span class='open-pill'>Volunteer</span></h3>
        <p class="muted">Takes meeting notes, keeps track of member attendance and hours, and handles internal club communication.</p>
